[h1]Hello![/h1]

[list]
[*] Added speed boost x2.5 (c.d. 20sec);
[*] Fixed collision on physic objects;
[*] Match burning time increased;
[*] Fixed objects that did not let the sound through themselves;
[*] Fixed hands and match animations;
[*] Fixed fire of match;
[*] Changed the chance of lamp breakage in the room. Now the lower the floor, the greater the chance;
[*] Fix collisions on objects, because of which it was impossible to take an object lying on them;
[*] New key model;
[*] Increased size of keys;
[*] Fixed infinite loop crash;
[*] New collisions on models;
[*] Decreased player collision;
[*] Decreased enemy collision;
[/list]

ːsteamhappyː
